    "No retrieved record demonstrates meaningful CNS access; all direct systemic exposure measurements are negative.",
    "Several records rely on total radioactivity or qualitative low brain levels rather than unbound parent concentrations.",
    "One record (C15) is internally mixed, reporting slow but appreciable D-DOPA brain uptake despite an impermeable label."
  ],
